{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carnaval Marbles</strong> fuses a <strong>systemic roguelike with French billiards</strong>. In a dark-fantasy carnival world, every shot counts: positioning, rebounds, and the synergies between your Talismans, Marble Bonuses, and Runes turn a simple game of billiards into a true combinatorial engine. No two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287950/extras/4090ddea418aa9a12a99400b932833ae.avif?t=1761764580\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique gameplay loop:</strong> hijack French billiards with hundreds of Talismans, Bonuses, and Runes to build infinite synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deep roguelike:</strong> every run is different; craft your strategy and face Bosses that can rewrite the rules mid-run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two playable Bosses (8 in the final version):</strong> each one changes the game\u2019s rules and forces you to adapt your build in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One playable character (8 in the final version):</strong> perfect to discover the game\u2019s core mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A striking universe:</strong> dark fantasy inspired by European folklore and old carnivals, blending anachronisms and mythology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessibility + depth:</strong> easy to learn thanks to a clear UI and integrated tutorials, yet designed so expert players can \u201cbreak the game\u201d with ruthless builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless replayability:</strong> after defeating all Bosses, Endless Mode lets you keep pushing your limits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287950/extras/1ab611aa91b568bb6321146e21fde5e4.avif?t=1761764580\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A systemic approach</strong><br>Carnaval Marbles follows in the footsteps of games like Balatro, where simple core rules hide dizzying combinatorial depth. Here, trajectory is your language: every shot can upend the run.<br>Ready your Talismans. Line up your marbles. The demo is only a taste\u2014the carnival has just begun.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3287950?t=1761764580","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287950/34ca40582853def04f91aec094ded70f1044ecb5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761764580","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287950/778fec36f777b2594c1cd7f417e7bf00b34dca3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761764580","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287950/778fec36f777b2594c1cd7f417e7bf00b34dca3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761764580","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4043940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carnaval Marbles</strong> fuses a <strong>systemic roguelike with French billiards</strong>. In a dark-fantasy carnival world, every shot counts: positioning, rebounds, and the synergies between your Talismans, Marble Bonuses, and Runes turn a simple game of billiards into a true combinatorial engine. No two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:/